{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "zoiko-workflow",
    "name": "ZoikoSuite - Workflow & Approvals",
    "description": "workflow-svc (port 8090, Doc 03 §8.4). Send identity-context-svc's envelope as the bearer token ({{identityEnvelope}}); in warn mode X-Principal-Id alone is still admitted. The collection pre-request script adds X-Tenant-Id, X-Principal-Id (unless the request sets its own), X-Correlation-ID, X-Request-Id, X-Source-Channel and, on writes, a fresh Idempotency-Key. Approvals need WORKFLOW_APPROVE (WORKFLOW_APPROVER template, access-control 000021); a delegate needs a live delegation from the stage's approver. Each decision returns decision_id, the governance-ledger record it is written under. Errors are RFC 9457 application/problem+json with error_class. Run the folders in order.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{identityEnvelope}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const v = (k) => pm.variables.get(k);",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'X-Tenant-Id', value: v('tenantId')});",
          "if (!pm.request.headers.has('X-Principal-Id')) { pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'X-Principal-Id', value: v('requesterId')}); }",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'X-Correlation-ID', value: v('correlationId')});",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'X-Request-Id', value: 'req_' + Date.now() + Math.floor(Math.random()*1e6)});",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'X-Source-Channel', value: 'api'});",
          "if (pm.request.method !== 'GET') {",
          "  if (!pm.request.headers.has('Idempotency-Key')) { pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'Idempotency-Key', value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}')}); }",
          "  pm.request.headers.upsert({key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json'});",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
